{"duration_api_ms":8193,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"357914b6-280c-49c4-9586-9b653ea237c9","total_cost_usd":0.0010752000000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":723,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1475,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1139},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":723,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1475,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":723,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":723},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1266,"outputTokens":1608,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":723,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0010752000000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1249,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":723,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Sub-fund level:** Under Irish UCITS rules, ETF status attaches to the **sub-fund**, not the umbrella. An umbrella is a single legal entity with segregated sub-funds. Only sub-funds that meet the ETF criteria (exchange listing with market-making, described as ETF features in the prospectus) are UCITS ETFs. The umbrella is not an ETF, and non-ETF sibling sub-funds must not be labelled as ETFs.\n\n**Listed-class level:** Trading identifiers (ISIN, ticker, listing venue such as Euronext Dublin, LSE or Xetra) attach to each **listed share class**. Unlisted classes in an ETF sub-fund share its UCITS ETF status but have no exchange ticker. Describe them as unlisted classes of a UCITS ETF, not as exchange-traded products.\n\nVerify against the current prospectus, the Central Bank of Ireland register and the venue listing for the specific ISIN. I cannot check live records.","ttft_ms":6063,"type":"result","duration_ms":7281,"uuid":"0db0d622-1764-40cf-adc7-96ee1776ea94","ttft_stream_ms":418,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":418,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
